/P 186 0 R
/E (The system was analysedtofinditsusers,functionalrequirementsand major entities. An entity relationship modelwaspreparedandconvertedintoarelational schema of 13 tables, normalized up toThirdNormalForm\(3NF\).Thedatabasewasimplemented in MySQL 8 with primary keys, foreignkeys,UNIQUE,NOTNULL,CHECK, ENUM and DEFAULT constraints, six indexesonfrequentlysearchedcolumns,andsixtriggers. A generated column, active_seat, makessurethataseathasonlyoneactivebookingper trip while still allowing a cancelled seat to bebookedagain.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
