/P 186 0 R
/E (The important businessrulesareenforcedinsidethedatabaseitself: one booking per seat per trip, no overlappingdutiesforadriver,conductororbus,validdeparture and arrival times, payment equal tothefare,andacancellationpolicythatrefunds90%, 50% or 0% of the fare depending on thetimeleftbeforedeparture.Theserulesweretested directly in MySQL, and every test gave theexpectedresult.Atthetimeofwriting,thesample data, report queries and the Python front-endarestillinprogressandaredescribedasremaining work. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
