/E (Bus operators run trips on fixed routes. Each trip uses one bus, one driver and one conductor, and passengers reserve individual seats. In many small operations, booking is still done with paper registers, phone calls and spreadsheets. These tools do not check whether a seat is already taken or whether a crew member is already on another trip. )
/Pg 16 0 R
