1154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (The active_seat column. The generated column solved a problem that a plain UNIQUE constraint could not: it blocks a second confirmed booking for a seat, yet lets the seat be sold again after a cancellation \(test 13\). Because the check is a UNIQUE index, it also works when two bookings are attempted at the same moment. )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
1155 0 obj
<<
